{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、こんばんはー！(小声"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は大好きなゆったんちゃんとお買い物してきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しいものも食べれて大満足！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったんといると、基本私は弾けてます。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また行こーね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい！\n質問に答えていきます(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▽ランドとシーどっちが好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ランドも好きだけどシーが好き！\nアトラクションどれも楽しいし、何よりダッフィーがいるからね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▽まいやんカラコン使ってるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"使ってません(；；)\n目が悪いので普通のコンタクトしてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▽冬になったら食べたいものは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これはミカンですね！\nSサイズのミカン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一日20個とか食べたことあります！\nそしたら指が黄色くなりました（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type"